  <entry>
    <title>Call for Justice: Cigarette Smoke Memories</title>
    <link href="https://miialona.github.io/call_for_justice_keith/"/>
    <id>https://miialona.github.io/call_for_justice_keith/</id>
    <published>2026-05-24T16:00:00.000Z</published>
    <updated>2026-05-25T01:04:54.338Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<div class="headerimg">    <img src="https://64.media.tumblr.com/a3d76e346693aff3ce17bcd6f73b5689/7c83cc088fbd7249-fb/s999999999x999999999/5cd5384d1b72162c7bab4eb0fc0d79dde7c2f749.png" alt="Call for Keith Max Evolved"></div><div class="three-wrapper">    <div class="info-area">        <div class="info">            <div class="info-item characters">                <div class="label">Characters</div>                <div class="value heliosch">                    <a href="/categories/HELIOS/11-Keith Max" character="Keith"></a>                    <a href="/categories/HELIOS/5-Gast Adler" character="Gast"></a>                    <a href="/categories/HELIOS/8-Marion Blythe" character="Marion"></a>                </div>            </div>            <div class="info-item one">                <div class="label">Release Date</div>                <div class="value">2023/10/11</div>            </div>            <div class="info-item two">                <div class="label">Translation</div>                <div class="value">                    <a href="/about">Miialona</a>                </div>            </div>            <div class="info-item three">                <div class="label">Proofreading</div>                <div class="value">                    <a href="https://x.com/yourdoorsteph">Steph</a>                </div>            </div>        </div>    </div></div><!-- Read More --><details class="note "><summary><p>location</p></summary><p><strong>Location:</strong> North Sector Living Room</p></details><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" eyesclosed><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Yup, I&#39;m done. My work here&#39;s done~...</p></div></div><div class="story-img"><img src="https://64.media.tumblr.com/1e901b07b457acd426b900044857e569/440d6150d3f9cf26-a0/s999999999x999999999/852a2d3501bcbdc43246e7cb3d824ad1ee284d5c.png"></div><div class=msr-unit character="Marion"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Wait. Where are you going.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" eyesclosed><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Where? Back to my room. Snacks are ready for the next &quot;Kid&#39;s Space&quot;, so I guess my work&#39;s done.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Marion"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>We still need to taste them.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" lookaway><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Euhh, is that really called for. Unless somthin&#39; major happens, we shouldn&#39;t have to remake em right...</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Marion"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>No, I&#39;ll treat you to a drink of tea or coffee as a thanks for helping because-</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>...?</p></div></div><div class="story-img"><img src="https://64.media.tumblr.com/50b2270fa3919f6f8ef5a006cac6ce13/440d6150d3f9cf26-dc/s999999999x999999999/eeba666f1b9d026107a46e3086831de87ab97a28.png"></div><div class=msr-unit character="Marion"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Are you back, Ren?</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>What an unusual sight...</p><p>Eugh...</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Marion"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>What&#39;s wrong?</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Aah, yer also bad with sweets huh? I guess yer room&#39;s flooded by the scent of buttercream now.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Marion"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Is that so? Are you feeling sick...?</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>That&#39;s how it feels for guys who don&#39; like sweets.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>... I&#39;m going to my room.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" happyeyeshalf><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Poor guy. I also get sick around those sickly-sweet scents too, so I get how it feels.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" happy><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Soo, I&#39;ll leave the tasting to you. After work beer is the best after all...♪</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Marion"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Wait.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" surprise><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Wh-what.... do ya really need a taste test that badly?</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Marion"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>That&#39;s enough. That scent reminded me, you should fix that cigarette stench.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" surprise><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Eeh?</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Marion"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>I don&#39;t think you should be allowed to come to the &quot;Kids Space&quot; reeking of cigarettes. Deal with it before we get complaints from the parents.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" lookaway><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>... Is it that bad?</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Marion"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Mhm. That&#39;s how it is for people who don&#39;t like that scent.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" eyesclosed><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Guh...</p></div></div><details class="note "><summary><p>location</p></summary><p><strong>Location:</strong> Rooftop</p></details><div class="story-img"><img src="https://64.media.tumblr.com/fee1bac7ac4cf6f9b3bcc2dd07094f69/440d6150d3f9cf26-83/s999999999x999999999/238b8d2d701d959e936cfcd7ce355e905bc4d626.png"></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" eyesclosed><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Fuu...<span class="thought">(A smoke at this time&#39;s the best...)</span></p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" lookaway><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p><span class="thought">(... The scent of cigarettes huh...)</span></p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p><span class="thought">(I don&#39;t usually think &#39;bout this kinda thing but, do they reek that much?)</span></p><p><span class="thought">(... I don&#39;t get it. Dino and the rookies haven&#39;t really said anything &#39;bout it)</span></p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" lookaway><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p><span class="thought">(Is Marion just oversensitive to scents? There aren&#39;t many smokers around here so...)</span></p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" eyesclosed><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p><span class="thought">(Well... maybe, smokers or cigarettes themselves leave a bad impression)</span></p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" lookaway><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p><span class="thought">(When I was in the Academy, teachers would get on my case a lot, digging through my stuff cuz it smelled like cigarettes)</span></p><p><span class="thought">(They&#39;d say &quot;Where have you hidden them&quot;.... I guess that&#39;s when they started keepin&#39; an eye on me, to the point where they&#39;d get suspicious of anything and everything I&#39;d do?)</span></p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p><span class="thought">(The smell of cigarettes really came from my dad, cuz his smoking infected all my things. I didn&#39;t like the scent too-)</span></p><p>Hm?</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>...!</p></div></div><div class="story-img"><img src="https://64.media.tumblr.com/83fe77c04a7dba60281a23e0aa1bccb7/440d6150d3f9cf26-1e/s999999999x999999999/495ef36a88c5bb35ff032ffd6bbab75ef1abd11e.png"></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" happy><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Ooh, is that Ren? How long&#39;ve you been there?</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>... I just got here.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>I see. What&#39;s up? Come to stargaze?</p><p>I also came to look at em. Despite looks, we&#39;re actually romantics huh.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>...</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" happyeyeshalf><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Oi, I&#39;m joking. Say something.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>... Well, I&#39;ll go back to smokin, don&#39;t worry yerself &#39;bout it.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>...</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" eyeshalf><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Ah my bad. Is the smoke in yer face?</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>...</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" eyesclosed><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p><span class="thought">(Oh jeez... will this be a repeat where he&#39;ll get the urge to dash or glare at me cuz of that &quot;scent&quot;)</span></p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>I don&#39;t hate the smell</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" surprise><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Eh?</p></div></div><div class="story-img"><img src="https://64.media.tumblr.com/8af15731ed56a1f7a6ef4a77b0e3bd24/440d6150d3f9cf26-e1/s999999999x999999999/955bfe3b24bfdaae23672bf3f9797d51d174d567.png"></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>... My dad used to smoke occasionally</p><p>It wasn&#39;t that frequent though...</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" eyeshalf><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Heeh...</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Mom and Neesan disliked it so, he made sure not to smoke often.</p><p>On clear days, he&#39;d sit in this chair in the garden, reading a book or the newspaper; just like today, where you can gaze at the beautiful starry sky.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren" happy><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>I didn&#39;t dislike it, I got the impression he was the kind of adult who enjoyed luxury goods.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" happyeyeshalf><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>...</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>... I&#39;ve said too much. Forget about it.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" eyesclosed><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>So that kinda trope exists too huh</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>?</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Ooh, don&#39;t worry &#39;bout it. Forget &#39;bout it too.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>...</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" happy><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Wanna try a smoke?</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>No thanks, I wouldn&#39;t smoke.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" happyeyeshalf><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Haha, I know.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>...</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Aah... I said I&#39;d go back after a smoke but, can I have another?</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Whatever, I don&#39;t mind.</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" happy><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>Thanks.</p></div></div><div class="story-img"><img src="https://64.media.tumblr.com/bb13aa8b30ff07d29be2a402e98f687c/440d6150d3f9cf26-81/s999999999x999999999/cec0613ee763a592b63b01d27fd5ece4c71bf1af.png"></div><div class=msr-unit character="Keith" happy><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>...</p></div></div><div class=msr-unit character="Ren"><div class=msr-icon><div class=msr-icon__wrapper><div class=msr-icon__base></div></div></div><div class=msr-name></div><div class=msr-line><p>...</p></div></div>]]></content>
    
    
